            {
                "entry_id": "5f069c17-188b-3728-a12e-f3a563a240e1",
                "word": "ne",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                        "entry_id": "5f069c17-188b-3728-a12e-f3a563a240e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eaaa10fc-0c73-4f45-8ea7-fd6ba024b9cc",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "For she ne dare doo, but to commande."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0478ac29-2ded-448e-9eec-55a30aa73863",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "And whan the good quene herde these pyteous tydynges lytel lacked that the ne dyed for sorowe / wherfore all lamentably the began to complayne her sayenge."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72ca9cf4-7333-4c7b-b3c6-302248b8ea16",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "This shold haue bene his skuce at the lest / And it ne had bene but good & honest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2678baa8-2065-4764-bbd3-46a9c563fc37",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "O so incessaunt thow ad in thy desyre / For so that thow thy mynde now mayst haue / Thow ne caryst what thow dost requyre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d44ebbb1-1555-4395-96d2-fa2a8715a43d",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "For he ne had, nor could increase his line."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de871a61-9cb1-4772-aef8-d7d043023e49",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "In geving me to him whom I ne can, ne may, ne ought to love."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "812e2509-215a-4fda-a433-6e9b616940bb",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "Mary (quoth the king) so might me mine, ne haddest thou been Earle Godwine: casting in his dish the murder of his brother Alfred, which was done to death at Elie by the Counsell of Godwine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29e5deef-0641-4ad5-8eb1-ed6f1f3570ef",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "Ne durst again his fieri face out-show."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f3a1ff2-8bf6-4d08-be2b-d7a494a3c5be",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "Ioc: How can that be and thou my ioy in warre? Po: Henceforth n'am I your ioy ne yet your sonne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc28fc09-4f52-4dd6-a115-93151ea59128",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "What happs might chance me I ne knewe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be0b1e2f-31fe-42f9-a914-34a66aaff66a",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "His forces faile, ne can no lenger fight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf77e000-238f-4997-a7d5-0c5a808a61c6",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "As when a ship, that flyes faire vnder saile, / An hidden rocke escaped hath vnwares, / That lay in waite her wrack for to bewaile, / The Marriner yet halfe amazed stares / At perill past, and yet it doubt ne dares / To ioy at his foole-happie ouersight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8a1a337-9f26-48ea-b819-2f37d37c8878",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "And now sweete death most welcome vnto mee, thy stroakes ne can, ne shall me once dismay."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14e2ef0e-43c5-4e38-a847-52ed7a31ca9b",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "And twenty thousand infants that ne wot the right hand from the left."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e4084b3-74de-4a03-b2f1-a1ce509a88dc",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "But when he spoke, his plenteous words did flow / Like to thick-falling flakes of winter snow, / Ne any couth his wit so hiely straine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3963c148-cb9b-4e1d-a653-e80bdb0175f6",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "Now, siker ( Wernocke ) thou hast split the marke / Albe that I ne wot I han mis-song: / But, for I am so yong, I dread my warke / Woll be misualued both of old and yong."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c2cd0fc-be43-487b-9a79-9227594ad543",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "Whilom in Albion's isle there dwelt a youth, / Who ne in virtue's ways did take delight [...]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "991a13da-b0d0-4079-a3ca-48830884b393",
                                "sense_id": "1dd93fe9-1ea8-3b23-833d-d21e20e8cf45",
                                "text": "\"God's nails, I ne knew her. I went to another stead in the yard to be further from her cries.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
